{"unit_id":"yang0__dsh-handraw-style#card-zh","repo":"yang0/dsh-handraw-style","commit":"11dbe87fef30438633d96d94f37aa5b49cea865c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-plugin-pose-studio**（DSH Web 图像创作插件）：把一句创作主题整理成视觉方案，并生成单张图或多页套图。它在 DSH Web 侧栏提供图像创作工作台，通过 DSH 默认模型规划画面，再调用 GPT Image 兼容接口生成或编辑图片。可选择画风、配色、版式、姿势、服装和人像参考，上传图片，按平台设定画幅，生成 PNG 或受模型支持的 GIF，并保存原图、下载单页或导出整套 ZIP。适合需要制作社媒套图、封面、知识卡、商品图或文章配图的创作者。生图需配置 API Key；规划可使用 DSH 默认模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:315-316","host.js:191-301","client.js:1170-1178"]}
{"unit_id":"yang0__dsh-handraw-style#card-en","repo":"yang0/dsh-handraw-style","commit":"11dbe87fef30438633d96d94f37aa5b49cea865c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-plugin-pose-studio** plans and generates image sets in DSH Web. It uses the DSH default model to plan scenes and a GPT Image compatible API to create PNGs or supported GIFs. Choose visual styles and references, then download images or export a ZIP. Image generation requires an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:315-316","host.js:191-301","client.js:1170-1178"]}
